def even_bit_toggle_number(n): 
    mask = 0
    i = 0
    while (n >> i): 
        if (i % 2 == 1): 
            mask |= (1 << i) 
        i += 1
    return (n ^ mask)
```

```python
def even_bit_toggle_number(n): 
    mask = 0 
    count = 0
    temp = n 
    while(temp > 0): 
        if (count % 2 == 0): 
            mask |= (1 << count) 
        count += 1
        temp >>= 1
    return (n ^ mask)
```

